1
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,680
Everyone knows that

2
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,120
I take very good care of my own people,

3
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,959
so I won't let you be wronged.

4
00:01:51,439 --> 00:01:52,760
Actually, regarding this matter,

5
00:01:53,319 --> 00:01:55,040
I've already briefed headquarters.

6
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:58,519
And besides, after all, this was

7
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,359
a random terrorist attack.

8
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,719
So...

9
00:02:03,079 --> 00:02:06,560
Right, I've already applied to headquarters

10
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,000
for a new dorm.

11
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:10,840
So, An Da, about this...

12
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,240
Fine, fine, I got it.

13
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,280
I'll figure something out myself.

14
00:02:14,919 --> 00:02:15,840
Great.

15
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:16,919
How is it?

16
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:19,159
This pork shank tastes pretty good, doesn't it?

17
00:02:19,759 --> 00:02:20,560
Delicious.

18
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,080
Even as a vegetarian,

19
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:25,520
I can tell this pork looks tough.

20
00:02:26,439 --> 00:02:28,159
You don't even eat it, yet you're so picky.

21
00:02:30,599 --> 00:02:32,639
Didn't have a single bite—regretting it now?

22
00:02:36,159 --> 00:02:37,080
Who's doing the dishes?

23
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:43,000
Sha Lan, sit down.

24
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:55,840
Didn't I tell you

25
00:02:56,199 --> 00:02:58,280
to tell her not to send a crane?

26
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:02,199
She insisted on going herself, so what could I do?

27
00:03:26,639 --> 00:03:28,319
Fine, fine. Go file a complaint.

28
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:31,960
Block A7, New World Bar.

29
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,400
Why did you come looking for me here?

30
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,719
The company followed your plan,

31
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:42,639
and that's when things went wrong.

32
00:03:42,759 --> 00:03:44,479
Don't you think you should compensate us?

33
00:03:45,719 --> 00:03:47,080
You should bear that yourselves.

34
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:48,800
I told Sha Lan to warn you

35
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,280
not to expose

36
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,879
the company logo to anyone.

37
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:54,120
You were supposed to paint over it.

38
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,240
You just wouldn't listen.

39
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:57,400
Now they came back for revenge,

40
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,759
and you're blaming me?

41
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:03,360
Any problem Party A encounters

42
00:04:03,919 --> 00:04:06,039
should be Party B's responsibility.

43
00:04:06,039 --> 00:04:07,680
Because you failed to protect us in time,

44
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,680
my dorm ended up getting bombed.

45
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,039
Find me a place to stay!

46
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,080
Fine by me.

47
00:04:15,199 --> 00:04:16,639
What kind of place? Name it.

48
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,600
I don't ask for much.

49
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:20,800
Doesn't need to be big, just safe.

50
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:23,199
Clean, and where my life isn't in danger.

51
00:04:23,519 --> 00:04:25,120
You pay for it.

52
00:04:33,839 --> 00:04:34,639
Sha Lan.

53
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:37,839
You're the one who signed this client.

54
00:04:39,399 --> 00:04:41,639
I never signed a residential lease.

55
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,360
Sha Lan.

56
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,439
Uh, An Da...

57
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,920
Why don't you sit and take a rest?

58
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:49,439
Did you pay your rent?

59
00:04:51,079 --> 00:04:53,240
Me? I work to pay off my rent.

60
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:54,600
Works for me.

61
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:55,720
Well, I have an objection.

62
00:04:56,199 --> 00:04:57,040
Sha Lan...

63
00:04:58,959 --> 00:04:59,759
Look here.

64
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:02,480
Uncle Qu is getting on in years.

65
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,519
He has so much work to do every day,

66
00:05:04,759 --> 00:05:06,839
mopping floors, cooking, right?

67
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:09,199
Now, someone's here to help.

68
00:05:09,199 --> 00:05:10,399
Isn't an extra hand great?

69
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:12,959
Uncle Qu, you might be older,

70
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:14,160
but you're in great shape.

71
00:05:14,319 --> 00:05:15,240
Who said that?

72
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,839
No, no, I'm not well at all.

73
00:05:17,319 --> 00:05:19,879
My back hurts, and my stomach's acting up.

74
00:05:20,519 --> 00:05:21,319
Besides,

75
00:05:21,319 --> 00:05:22,279
every day,

76
00:05:22,279 --> 00:05:24,399
you want this to eat and that to eat.

77
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:26,040
How can Uncle Qu keep up with that?

78
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:26,879
Let me tell you,

79
00:05:26,879 --> 00:05:28,560
this girl used to work in a hotel.

80
00:05:28,959 --> 00:05:31,000
She can definitely cook lots of good food.

81
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,040
Right, An Da?

82
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:33,720
I'll do my best.

83
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,480
No way.

84
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:38,040
Earning my keep through honest labor...

85
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:39,120
Um, Uncle Qu,

86
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:41,839
can I help you out here?

87
00:05:43,959 --> 00:05:45,040
I can tell.

88
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:47,360
You guys are all messing with me, right?

89
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:53,000
Forget it.

90
00:05:53,519 --> 00:05:54,319
Just tell me,

91
00:05:54,879 --> 00:05:56,079
which room are you giving her?

92
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,279
Well, it's a bit messy.

93
00:06:07,759 --> 00:06:08,439
Not at all.

94
00:06:08,439 --> 00:06:08,839
I...

95
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,279
I think it's great.

96
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,800
So you don't need me to help tidy up?

97
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,199
No, no, I'll do it myself.

98
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,519
All right. Let me know if you need anything.

99
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,920
Okay, thank you, Uncle Qu.

100
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:17,959
Ms. An,

101
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,279
do you have any basic manners?

102
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:23,920
I'm sorry.

103
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,000
I didn't mean to.

104
00:07:27,199 --> 00:07:29,279
Are you here to stay or to hit on guys?

105
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,560
Sha Lan, I didn't mean anything like that.

106
00:07:32,759 --> 00:07:33,920
I just didn't want to freeload,

107
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:35,800
so I cooked and did chores for you.

108
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,399
Don't you dare try anything.

109
00:07:37,399 --> 00:07:38,759
I'll nip that in the bud right now.

110
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:42,240
What are you doing? Get out of here right now!

111
00:08:03,879 --> 00:08:04,680
Ms. An,

112
00:08:05,199 --> 00:08:06,639
Th-this really doesn't seem right.

113
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:08,519
You're just staying here,

114
00:08:08,519 --> 00:08:10,040
not working as our maid.

115
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:12,040
No need to work yourself to the bone.

116
00:08:12,519 --> 00:08:13,319
It's fine.

117
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,439
By staying here,

118
00:08:14,439 --> 00:08:16,120
I've caused everyone so much trouble.

119
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:17,480
So if I don't do something,

120
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,720
I just wouldn't feel right.

121
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:20,959
Besides, I feel really safe here.

122
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,279
Wei Tian.

123
00:08:39,639 --> 00:08:41,279
Need me to get you anything else?

124
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,519
That's all.

125
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,039
Just say the word anytime.

126
00:08:57,879 --> 00:08:59,600
Hi, what can I get you?

127
00:09:01,399 --> 00:09:02,200
A drink.

128
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,240
That chick not your type?

129
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,399
Not my type at all.

130
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,720
Well, how about me?

131
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,080
You're the best.

132
00:09:26,519 --> 00:09:28,159
So, any news?

133
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:29,600
What's the rush?

134
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,200
Have a drink with me.

135
00:09:42,399 --> 00:09:43,120
No, no, no.

136
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:43,879
It's fine, come on.

137
00:09:43,879 --> 00:09:45,039
No, no, wait.

138
00:09:45,639 --> 00:09:46,039
Come on.

139
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,759
What are you doing? Don't touch me!

140
00:09:47,759 --> 00:09:48,639
Is there a misunderstanding?

141
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:49,399
Come on.

142
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:51,679
Don't touch me!

143
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:55,600
Got it, let's talk later.

144
00:09:56,279 --> 00:09:58,440
Don't be shy. Just want to make friends.

145
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,080
What are you doing here?

146
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:12,679
What am I doing here?

147
00:10:12,679 --> 00:10:14,840
I haven't even asked what you're doing here.

148
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,840
And you're asking me?

149
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:22,159
See that girl over there?

150
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,919
She's the Hawkeye around here.

151
00:10:26,679 --> 00:10:28,639
She sells intel to the people here.

152
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:31,840
And the other one,

153
00:10:32,679 --> 00:10:33,840
the guy with the beard,

154
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:35,200
is named Chuck.

155
00:10:36,039 --> 00:10:37,240
As long as you can pay,

156
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,879
local IDs, passports...

157
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,240
you can buy whatever you want.

158
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,840
The white-haired guy on the far right,

159
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:46,720
is named Wilson.

160
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,080
He's the head of the local chamber of commerce.

161
00:10:48,639 --> 00:10:49,639
Whatever the dispute,

162
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,159
he can sort it out for you.

163
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:58,039
She drank too much.

164
00:10:58,519 --> 00:10:59,559
She's in a bad mood.

165
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:02,519
Captain, unlock the door for her.

166
00:11:07,679 --> 00:11:08,840
She's a grown adult.

167
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:11,120
Going out drinking without being careful.

168
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,879
Why'd you let her look for me there?

169
00:11:12,879 --> 00:11:13,960
Why didn't you keep an eye on her?

170
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,200
Look at how you talk.

171
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,559
Why are you siding with outsiders?

172
00:11:16,559 --> 00:11:17,480
You said it yourself:

173
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,879
we're just her security consultants,

174
00:11:18,879 --> 00:11:20,240
not her full-time bodyguards.

175
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:21,720
Where she goes, what she does,

176
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,600
whether she's going to work

177
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:23,639
or meeting up with her little lover,

178
00:11:23,639 --> 00:11:24,759
none of that is our business.

179
00:11:26,919 --> 00:11:27,960
Am I wrong?

180
00:11:29,919 --> 00:11:31,159
If something like this happens,

181
00:11:31,559 --> 00:11:33,759
just let me know next time.

182
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:56,799
Dad! Mom!

183
00:11:58,120 --> 00:12:00,519
I can't find my parents.

184
00:12:02,279 --> 00:12:04,840
Come with me, little girl.

185
00:12:05,559 --> 00:12:07,159
Dad!

186
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:14,360
Mom!

187
00:12:17,799 --> 00:12:19,399
It's been seven years already.

188
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:22,759
What's up?

189
00:12:22,759 --> 00:12:24,480
Need something? I'm busy over there.

190
00:12:26,039 --> 00:12:26,679
Yeah.

191
00:12:31,759 --> 00:12:34,720
Antilocaris, your passport.

192
00:12:49,759 --> 00:12:50,240
I...

193
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:53,759
All these years,

194
00:12:53,759 --> 00:12:55,000
I haven't had any family.

195
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,360
It's only been you.

196
00:12:56,879 --> 00:12:58,840
I never had an identity.

197
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:01,279
So does this mean...

198
00:13:01,279 --> 00:13:02,440
I have an identity now?

199
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:05,320
O-Of course.

200
00:13:08,519 --> 00:13:09,360
Stand up!

201
00:13:10,519 --> 00:13:11,240
What is it?

202
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:11,960
Get up!

203
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:16,440
Sticking with you really pays off!

204
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,080
I have an identity now!

205
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:20,799
I can go travel now!

206
00:13:45,639 --> 00:13:47,840
You're bullying me like I'm Harry Potter!

207
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:49,120
Waking me up at seven?

208
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:50,799
Who set the time? Who set the alarm?

209
00:13:50,799 --> 00:13:51,679
When did you set it?

210
00:13:51,679 --> 00:13:52,919
I told Sha Lan to set it.

211
00:13:53,159 --> 00:13:54,519
The goal was to wake you up.

212
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:57,080
Working here means following our rules.

213
00:13:57,639 --> 00:13:59,399
None of them are even awake yet.

214
00:13:59,399 --> 00:14:01,240
Why do I have to get up first?

215
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:02,320
What kind of rule is that?

216
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,679
The rules for living here.

217
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,960
When we tell you to wake up,

218
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,279
you have to get up.

219
00:14:11,679 --> 00:14:12,679
That's just bullying!

220
00:14:13,559 --> 00:14:14,720
You just want me to do laundry, right?

221
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,840
Fine, give me the clothes. Hand them over.

222
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:18,120
No laundry today.

223
00:14:18,639 --> 00:14:19,600
It's seven thirty now.

224
00:14:22,399 --> 00:14:23,399
Work starts at nine.

225
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,440
It's a 20-minute walk.

226
00:14:25,519 --> 00:14:26,919
Ten minutes for you to wash up,

227
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:28,279
and for the other hour,

228
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:30,320
translate this for me.

229
00:14:30,639 --> 00:14:32,759
You speak French and English,

230
00:14:32,919 --> 00:14:33,320
right?

231
00:14:34,399 --> 00:14:35,080
Of course.

232
00:14:36,159 --> 00:14:37,360
Great, that's perfect.

233
00:14:38,399 --> 00:14:39,360
Within one hour:

234
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:41,399
two in English, one in French.

235
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:45,840
Ten minutes isn't enough time to get ready!

236
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:47,840
My makeup alone takes 30 minutes!

237
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:48,720
Why wear makeup?

238
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:50,039
You look the same with or without it.

239
00:14:52,039 --> 00:14:53,279
Meaning I'm naturally gorgeous?

240
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:54,840
Nothing special either way.

241
00:14:57,159 --> 00:14:58,960
40 minutes to get ready.

242
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,799
I can finish these in half an hour.

243
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,039
Suit yourself.

244
00:15:02,679 --> 00:15:03,360
Yes, sir.

245
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,000
Fine.

246
00:15:05,279 --> 00:15:07,000
Acting so high and mighty!

247
00:15:07,639 --> 00:15:09,679
He can't do anything, and I'm the client!

248
00:15:09,679 --> 00:15:11,279
Treating the client with zero respect!

249
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:14,039
Acting like a domineering CEO. Honestly!

250
00:15:15,799 --> 00:15:16,600
What did you say?

251
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:17,279
I said...

252
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:19,799
Boss Wei, you're in great shape!

253
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,720
Yours is pretty average.

254
00:15:48,519 --> 00:15:50,320
It's mine now. Hand it over.

255
00:15:51,679 --> 00:15:53,879
Stop! Put that money back!

256
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:56,200
Don't you know the rules around here?

257
00:15:56,279 --> 00:15:57,039
Everyone on this street...

258
00:15:57,039 --> 00:15:58,559
...has to pay me protection money.

259
00:15:59,919 --> 00:16:00,759
Listen to me.

260
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,200
Either he pays protection money,

261
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:03,360
or you come with me.

262
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:05,480
And everyone else still pays up!

263
00:16:05,519 --> 00:16:06,440
Qite, collect the money.

264
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:28,519
Move, move!

265
00:16:46,399 --> 00:16:47,200
Wei Tian.

266
00:16:48,279 --> 00:16:49,840
I wasn't meddling.

267
00:16:49,879 --> 00:16:51,799
I was just standing up for them.

268
00:16:52,759 --> 00:16:53,960
Look, I promise...

269
00:16:53,960 --> 00:16:56,240
I promise I won't ever do it again.

270
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:58,399
Don't give me the silent treatment.

271
00:16:58,480 --> 00:17:01,480
Wei Tian, Wei Tian, I...

272
00:17:02,519 --> 00:17:03,320
Wei Tian!

273
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:08,920
Wasn't I just doing the right thing?

274
00:17:13,559 --> 00:17:16,400
Me? I only know how to make home-cooked dishes.

275
00:17:16,519 --> 00:17:18,839
Your fridge had plenty of ingredients,

276
00:17:19,119 --> 00:17:21,960
so I whipped up a few dishes for you.

277
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:24,759
All right, dig in!

278
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:26,640
I didn't help out at all.

279
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:34,559
Th-Th-This... Why is it so bland?

280
00:17:34,559 --> 00:17:35,720
It has no flavor at all.

281
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:43,400
I grew up not using salt, so...

282
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:46,200
Well, don't bring your family habits here.

283
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:47,680
After all, we're not used to it.

284
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:49,319
Hush, be quiet.

285
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:52,720
This taste seems to remind me of something.

286
00:17:53,559 --> 00:17:54,640
Th-This is...

287
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,880
I didn't remember a thing.

288
00:18:07,279 --> 00:18:08,680
She lost her memory.

289
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:11,319
She doesn't know her real identity.

290
00:18:12,519 --> 00:18:14,759
Isn't she a Silent Protector?

291
00:18:14,799 --> 00:18:17,000
Yes, we know she's a Silent Protector,

292
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:18,680
but she doesn't know who she is.

293
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:19,400
That's why...

294
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:21,720
we're trying all sorts of ways,

295
00:18:22,119 --> 00:18:25,200
including taste, to jog her memory.

296
00:18:27,119 --> 00:18:29,640
Luo Xi, starting today,

297
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:31,680
I'll cook all kinds of dishes for you.

298
00:19:51,119 --> 00:19:52,079
You're back.

299
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:53,519
I finished cleaning up.

300
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:55,400
What are you doing in my room?

301
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:57,079
Just helping you clean.

302
00:19:57,119 --> 00:19:58,920
I hate it when people touch my things!

303
00:19:59,359 --> 00:20:00,640
Who said you could go into my room?

304
00:20:06,319 --> 00:20:07,200
Don't you know

305
00:20:07,319 --> 00:20:09,000
no one's allowed to just touch my things?!

306
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:10,640
Do you know how much these dolls

307
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:11,720
mean to me?

308
00:20:13,039 --> 00:20:14,799
Don't you ever go into my room again!

309
00:20:17,599 --> 00:20:18,400
All right, calm down.

310
00:20:18,880 --> 00:20:20,759
We know those dolls mean a lot to you.

311
00:20:21,599 --> 00:20:23,640
But An Da was just trying to help.

312
00:20:25,319 --> 00:20:26,880
I don't want her in my room again,

313
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:28,039
and I don't want to see her.

314
00:20:46,799 --> 00:20:47,759
The people around here...

315
00:20:48,279 --> 00:20:50,759
each have their own past.

316
00:20:51,720 --> 00:20:53,000
They can't move past it,

317
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:55,039
and won't let anyone in.

318
00:20:57,480 --> 00:21:00,240
But what did I do wrong?

319
00:21:01,359 --> 00:21:03,799
You didn't do anything wrong.

320
00:21:07,039 --> 00:21:08,039
Let me tell you.

321
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:11,319
Back when I was in Greenland,

322
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:12,720
we were once...

323
00:21:12,720 --> 00:21:15,079
trekking through the snow.

324
00:21:15,519 --> 00:21:16,880
We walked for over a week.

325
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:19,000
No one said a word.

326
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:22,000
Nobody wanted to break the silence.

327
00:21:22,279 --> 00:21:23,400
Even without speaking,

328
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:24,960
deep down,

329
00:21:25,119 --> 00:21:26,920
we could all sense each other.

330
00:21:28,160 --> 00:21:29,400
Ever since then,

331
00:21:30,079 --> 00:21:32,839
our bond grew even stronger.

332
00:21:34,839 --> 00:21:37,359
So, what did you actually do back then?

333
00:21:38,079 --> 00:21:38,880
Me?

334
00:21:40,799 --> 00:21:42,680
I just drifted around.

335
00:21:45,440 --> 00:21:47,000
It's definitely the backup power.

336
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:48,480
I'll go check it out.

337
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:51,839
Another blackout.

338
00:21:56,759 --> 00:21:57,599
Let's go outside.

339
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:07,440
Take a walk out there.

340
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:09,720
I'll pass.

341
00:22:09,720 --> 00:22:11,279
I still have work to finish.

342
00:22:12,519 --> 00:22:13,359
I'm off, then.

343
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:18,000
Don't go. Stay and keep me company.

344
00:22:19,759 --> 00:22:23,319
Look at An Da, she's so annoying.

345
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:24,799
Why won't Wei Tian kick her out?

346
00:22:24,799 --> 00:22:26,359
Why let her stay here with us?

347
00:22:27,079 --> 00:22:29,160
Didn't you sign An Da yourself?

348
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:32,400
Don't bring that up!

349
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:33,960
I regret it so much now.

350
00:22:34,720 --> 00:22:35,640
Well, tell me then.

351
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:37,400
How is An Da annoying?

352
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:40,279
Actually,

353
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:43,440
I can't put my finger on it.

354
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:45,400
I just feel...

355
00:22:47,119 --> 00:22:48,519
I just feel like...

356
00:22:49,799 --> 00:22:51,400
You think Wei Tian likes her.

357
00:23:00,359 --> 00:23:03,000
Wei Tian, when I cleaned your room,

358
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:04,640
I saw the photo in there.

359
00:23:05,279 --> 00:23:06,119
Are they...

360
00:23:07,079 --> 00:23:10,400
That's my wife and daughter.

361
00:23:12,799 --> 00:23:14,079
They're both so beautiful.

362
00:23:22,119 --> 00:23:23,160
The sunset here

363
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:25,240
is so much nicer than Shenzhen's.

364
00:23:25,599 --> 00:23:26,960
Because there are no skyscrapers,

365
00:23:27,839 --> 00:23:29,000
it looks wide open.

366
00:23:29,559 --> 00:23:30,920
Every time I watch the sunset,

367
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:34,240
I think of my daughter.

368
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:36,000
She loved them too.

369
00:23:36,920 --> 00:23:38,160
If she were still alive,

370
00:23:39,440 --> 00:23:40,480
by now,

371
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:42,839
she'd be around Sha Lan's age.

372
00:23:45,759 --> 00:23:46,559
May I ask...

373
00:23:48,319 --> 00:23:49,960
what happened to them?

374
00:23:53,319 --> 00:23:54,359
We went on a vacation,

375
00:23:56,039 --> 00:23:57,480
and got caught in a terrorist attack.

376
00:23:59,880 --> 00:24:00,799
I'm so sorry.

377
00:24:01,240 --> 00:24:02,039
It's all right.

378
00:24:04,640 --> 00:24:08,799
So... did they ever find the attackers?

379
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:12,240
I don't know.

380
00:24:13,799 --> 00:24:16,640
The world may seem peaceful,

381
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:20,480
yet danger lurks everywhere.

382
00:24:23,160 --> 00:24:25,920
Anytime, anywhere,

383
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:28,839
regardless of nationality or race,

384
00:24:28,839 --> 00:24:29,480
just for you.

385
00:26:00,799 --> 00:26:01,680
Tell me,

386
00:26:02,359 --> 00:26:04,119
why is it that some people

387
00:26:05,200 --> 00:26:07,200
stay trapped in their memories

388
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:09,319
and can't move on?

389
00:26:10,279 --> 00:26:11,119
I don't know.

390
00:26:11,720 --> 00:26:12,720
All I know is

391
00:26:13,200 --> 00:26:15,480
my dream girl walked into my restaurant,

392
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:17,720
and now she's right across from me.

393
00:26:18,200 --> 00:26:19,519
I'm so happy.

394
00:26:21,799 --> 00:26:23,799
Who's your dream girl?

395
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:26,039
The one having a drink.

396
00:26:29,960 --> 00:26:30,759
Open the door.

397
00:26:49,079 --> 00:26:50,279
What are you hiding back there for?

398
00:26:50,559 --> 00:26:52,000
You think I can't see you?

399
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:52,680
Come out.

400
00:27:02,319 --> 00:27:03,240
What do you want?

401
00:27:03,240 --> 00:27:04,039
We heard...

402
00:27:05,279 --> 00:27:09,480
...business has been good here lately.

403
00:27:10,000 --> 00:27:10,880
Not at all.

404
00:27:10,960 --> 00:27:12,680
Look around, it's dead here.

405
00:27:12,680 --> 00:27:13,359
There's nobody around.

406
00:27:13,359 --> 00:27:16,039
Our men have been watching this place.

407
00:27:16,880 --> 00:27:18,759
Is there no law here anymore?

408
00:27:19,279 --> 00:27:21,079
If you do this, I'll... I'll call the police!

409
00:27:21,400 --> 00:27:22,119
Around here...

410
00:27:22,119 --> 00:27:23,920
...our boss's word is the law.

411
00:27:23,960 --> 00:27:24,759
Grab her!

412
00:27:25,960 --> 00:27:27,559
Let her go! Let her go!

413
00:27:27,960 --> 00:27:28,759
Let go of me!

414
00:27:35,640 --> 00:27:36,599
Get over here! Hurry!

415
00:27:37,079 --> 00:27:38,160
Get down! Down! Down!

416
00:27:49,319 --> 00:27:50,400
Just you wait!

417
00:27:52,119 --> 00:27:52,640
What is it?

418
00:27:54,160 --> 00:27:55,960
Where are you? What happened?

419
00:27:56,160 --> 00:27:57,039
I'm in Casablanca.

420
00:27:57,039 --> 00:27:58,359
Something's gone wrong here! Come save me!

421
00:27:58,680 --> 00:28:00,759
Stay safe. I'm on my way.

422
00:28:23,079 --> 00:28:23,880
Follow me.

423
00:28:24,400 --> 00:28:25,160
Open the door.

424
00:28:25,160 --> 00:28:26,720
Hurry, open the door!

425
00:28:26,880 --> 00:28:28,240
Open up! Open up!

426
00:28:32,480 --> 00:28:33,880
Careful, watch your step.

427
00:28:41,440 --> 00:28:41,759
Hurry!

428
00:28:50,039 --> 00:28:51,720
What useless trash!

429
00:28:51,720 --> 00:28:53,640
You're useless, too. You're all useless!

430
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:54,960
Find them right now!

431
00:28:56,759 --> 00:28:57,559
Stop!

432
00:29:00,759 --> 00:29:02,079
Chinese bodyguard.

433
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:03,400
This is my client's bar.

434
00:29:03,400 --> 00:29:04,319
I'm here to protect it.

435
00:29:04,599 --> 00:29:05,839
I don't know anything.

436
00:29:05,839 --> 00:29:06,960
I just got here,

437
00:29:06,960 --> 00:29:08,880
only to find my men lying on the ground.

438
00:29:09,720 --> 00:29:10,920
Then please leave.

439
00:29:14,759 --> 00:29:15,559
What's going on?

440
00:29:17,119 --> 00:29:18,079
What happened?

441
00:29:18,119 --> 00:29:19,799
Someone's causing trouble at my client's.

442
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:22,359
He's my friend Steven.

443
00:29:22,599 --> 00:29:23,720
What are you doing here?

444
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:26,079
Nothing.

445
00:29:26,079 --> 00:29:27,720
I just came here for a drink.

446
00:29:27,839 --> 00:29:30,079
Looks like that's not happening now.

447
00:29:30,279 --> 00:29:31,279
What a bore.

448
00:29:31,680 --> 00:29:32,359
Let's go.

449
00:29:40,119 --> 00:29:41,039
Take them away.

450
00:29:41,359 --> 00:29:41,880
Right away, sir.

451
00:29:46,039 --> 00:29:47,000
Starting today,

452
00:29:47,039 --> 00:29:48,200
station two men here on guard.

453
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:49,559
Report any problems to me.

454
00:29:49,559 --> 00:29:51,200
But they haven't signed a contract with us.

455
00:29:51,839 --> 00:29:52,880
They're Chinese.

456
00:29:52,920 --> 00:29:54,119
We have to protect them.

457
00:29:54,160 --> 00:29:55,359
Follow my orders.

458
00:29:56,240 --> 00:29:56,680
Yes, sir.

459
00:30:05,599 --> 00:30:07,519
Boss Zuo, you should be safe now.

460
00:30:08,279 --> 00:30:09,200
Looks like this time

461
00:30:09,200 --> 00:30:09,920
I really do need to sign

462
00:30:09,920 --> 00:30:11,359
a security agreement with Zhong An.

463
00:30:11,920 --> 00:30:13,799
Why not consider Silent Protectors?

464
00:30:13,799 --> 00:30:14,759
Silent Protectors?

465
00:30:14,920 --> 00:30:16,559
They wouldn't bother with small accounts like mine.

466
00:30:22,279 --> 00:30:23,079
An Da.

467
00:30:23,799 --> 00:30:24,599
I'm heading out.

468
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:27,960
Well, I'll go inside and clean up.

469
00:30:28,880 --> 00:30:30,119
You two go ahead and talk.

470
00:30:34,559 --> 00:30:36,680
I brought a whole team out here

471
00:30:36,720 --> 00:30:37,720
to bail you out just now.

472
00:30:37,720 --> 00:30:38,960
Not even a thank-you?

473
00:30:39,160 --> 00:30:39,960
Thank you.

474
00:30:40,799 --> 00:30:41,599
You're welcome.

475
00:30:42,279 --> 00:30:43,079
By the way,

476
00:30:43,559 --> 00:30:44,480
if you need it,

477
00:30:44,480 --> 00:30:46,200
I can do a security assessment for you.

478
00:30:46,200 --> 00:30:47,079
If it's unsafe,

479
00:30:47,079 --> 00:30:48,319
I can assign someone to protect you.

480
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:49,759
Don't bother with all that trouble.

481
00:30:51,599 --> 00:30:52,400
By the way,

482
00:30:53,359 --> 00:30:55,440
how did you get my phone number?

483
00:30:57,319 --> 00:30:57,960
Zhong An is the biggest

484
00:30:57,960 --> 00:30:59,279
Chinese security company around here.

485
00:30:59,279 --> 00:31:00,559
Tracking you down was hardly difficult.

486
00:31:03,839 --> 00:31:06,160
Mom, everything's fine.

487
00:31:06,759 --> 00:31:08,200
Work is going really well,

488
00:31:08,319 --> 00:31:09,519
and it's very safe here.

489
00:31:09,920 --> 00:31:11,920
Someone at your company told me

490
00:31:12,279 --> 00:31:14,200
that your dormitory was bombed!

491
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:15,559
Did that really happen?

492
00:31:16,200 --> 00:31:17,000
No, not at all.

493
00:31:17,720 --> 00:31:19,079
That was another hotel.

494
00:31:20,759 --> 00:31:22,119
Besides, for safety reasons,

495
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:24,119
none of us are staying there anymore.

496
00:31:24,359 --> 00:31:25,759
Then where are you staying right now?

497
00:31:26,519 --> 00:31:27,440
Has the company arranged

498
00:31:27,440 --> 00:31:28,799
a new dorm for you?

499
00:31:32,119 --> 00:31:35,400
We can't move into the new dorm yet,

500
00:31:35,400 --> 00:31:37,880
but I'm staying at a friend's place.

501
00:31:38,400 --> 00:31:41,000
They're so wonderful to me.

502
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:43,079
They treat me really well.

503
00:31:43,079 --> 00:31:44,759
They even gave me the best room

504
00:31:44,960 --> 00:31:47,200
and take very good care of me.

505
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:48,759
Honey,

506
00:31:50,880 --> 00:31:51,799
Mom knows

507
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:54,119
it's hard for you out there on your own.

508
00:31:55,519 --> 00:31:57,359
You only share good news, never the bad,

509
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,720
always just telling me the good parts.

510
00:32:06,119 --> 00:32:08,359
Since you're staying at your friend's place,

511
00:32:08,720 --> 00:32:09,839
help out around the house.

512
00:32:10,599 --> 00:32:12,160
Don't be a burden to them.

513
00:32:21,519 --> 00:32:23,559
All right, don't worry, Mom.

514
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:26,119
I'm going to sleep now.

515
00:32:26,920 --> 00:32:28,400
Take good care of yourself, okay?

516
00:32:52,599 --> 00:32:54,599
Why is Mr. Xiao late again?

517
00:32:54,599 --> 00:32:56,759
Wasn't the meeting set for ten?

518
00:32:57,480 --> 00:32:58,960
Not like we have much to do today anyway.

519
00:32:59,160 --> 00:33:00,039
Just wait a bit.

520
00:33:00,039 --> 00:33:00,839
Yeah.

521
00:33:00,880 --> 00:33:02,759
You know what Mr. Xiao is like.

522
00:33:04,279 --> 00:33:06,920
How is he even a boss?

523
00:33:06,920 --> 00:33:08,279
It's completely ridiculous.

524
00:33:09,359 --> 00:33:11,599
Fine, might as well wait until clock-out.

525
00:33:12,400 --> 00:33:13,839
Why are you acting like this too?

526
00:33:15,400 --> 00:33:16,359
Look, Manager An.

527
00:33:17,000 --> 00:33:18,640
Could you just relax?

528
00:33:19,319 --> 00:33:20,519
When I first arrived here,

529
00:33:20,519 --> 00:33:21,319
I was just like you,

530
00:33:21,720 --> 00:33:23,200
always so eager to work.

531
00:33:23,519 --> 00:33:24,680
But then I realized

532
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:26,640
this place isn't meant

533
00:33:26,640 --> 00:33:28,039
for impatient people.

534
00:33:31,240 --> 00:33:32,039
Hang in there!

535
00:33:32,559 --> 00:33:34,599
I... I can't see anything.

536
00:33:41,400 --> 00:33:43,480
Forget it. Something must've come up for him.

537
00:33:47,039 --> 00:33:48,559
I'll host today's meeting.

538
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:49,799
Let's begin.

539
00:33:54,359 --> 00:33:55,160
An Da.

540
00:33:55,240 --> 00:33:56,359
I'm outside your hotel.

541
00:33:56,480 --> 00:33:57,599
Manager Xiao is injured.

542
00:33:58,880 --> 00:34:00,480
Okay, I'm heading over right now.

543
00:34:00,519 --> 00:34:01,640
Mr. Xiao is outside the hotel.

544
00:34:01,640 --> 00:34:03,000
He's hurt. Let's go see.

545
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:03,759
Let's go.

546
00:34:07,759 --> 00:34:08,559
Where is he?

547
00:34:09,239 --> 00:34:10,599
The ambulance just took him to the hospital.

548
00:34:10,599 --> 00:34:11,760
Then let's head to the hospital.

549
00:34:11,760 --> 00:34:13,639
I'll get the car. Wait here a second.

550
00:34:21,199 --> 00:34:22,519
Mr. Xiao, are you all right?

551
00:34:23,199 --> 00:34:24,760
He... he... You...

552
00:34:26,400 --> 00:34:27,199
I'm sorry!

553
00:34:28,239 --> 00:34:29,320
Where are you hurt?

554
00:34:31,159 --> 00:34:34,079
Where... where am I hurt?

555
00:34:34,079 --> 00:34:35,559
Right where you're pressing!

556
00:34:35,559 --> 00:34:36,519
Where do you think I'm hurt?!

557
00:34:40,079 --> 00:34:41,239
How... how...

558
00:34:41,239 --> 00:34:42,679
How badly is he hurt?

559
00:34:43,559 --> 00:34:44,880
Is his life in danger?

560
00:34:44,920 --> 00:34:46,760
It's not life-threatening for now.

561
00:34:58,599 --> 00:35:01,719
Did you see what the attacker looked like?

562
00:35:01,719 --> 00:35:03,280
Or did he say anything to you?

563
00:35:03,719 --> 00:35:04,719
Let's call the police now,

564
00:35:04,719 --> 00:35:07,000
and we can tell them.

565
00:35:08,840 --> 00:35:10,280
No need to call the police.

566
00:35:11,079 --> 00:35:12,440
It's j-just a scratch.

567
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:14,239
I'm fine, really. Don't call the police.

568
00:35:35,360 --> 00:35:40,000
If the terrorists track me down,

569
00:35:40,239 --> 00:35:42,360
will I become their target?

570
00:35:42,559 --> 00:35:43,360
Impossible.

571
00:35:43,719 --> 00:35:45,800
But they already bombed my place.

572
00:35:45,920 --> 00:35:47,199
If I'd been in the room,

573
00:35:47,199 --> 00:35:48,280
I'd be the one dead.

574
00:35:48,519 --> 00:35:49,880
When they bombed your place,

575
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:51,480
they timed it for when you were out.

576
00:35:52,000 --> 00:35:54,760
They just wanted to scare you.

577
00:35:54,760 --> 00:35:56,039
They didn't want to kill you.

578
00:35:58,519 --> 00:36:00,840
Then what if they can't find me?

579
00:36:01,599 --> 00:36:03,480
Will they target the people around me

580
00:36:05,119 --> 00:36:05,599
for revenge?

581
00:36:07,440 --> 00:36:08,199
Revenge on who?

582
00:36:09,159 --> 00:36:09,880
No, no, no.

583
00:36:10,320 --> 00:36:12,719
Just, if something like that really happens,

584
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:15,639
can you protect me and my colleagues?

585
00:36:17,880 --> 00:36:18,679
Sure.

586
00:36:19,159 --> 00:36:20,559
Sign a contract with Sha Lan.

587
00:36:21,199 --> 00:36:23,199
Pay up, and we'll get to work.

588
00:36:23,920 --> 00:36:26,400
Wha— Why are you so mercenary?

589
00:36:26,800 --> 00:36:28,320
All you talk about is money.

590
00:36:28,400 --> 00:36:29,719
Would you really just leave people to die?

591
00:36:32,639 --> 00:36:35,280
Did you get into trouble again?

592
00:36:35,360 --> 00:36:36,159
Me?

593
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:38,679
So what if I did?

594
00:36:40,480 --> 00:36:41,400
Stay away from us.

595
00:36:42,239 --> 00:36:43,039
Why?

596
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:45,079
Don't drag us into this.

597
00:36:45,400 --> 00:36:45,960
I...

598
00:36:57,679 --> 00:36:58,280
Luo Xi.

599
00:36:59,400 --> 00:37:00,599
Here, have some juice.

600
00:37:02,000 --> 00:37:02,800
What's the matter?

601
00:37:04,840 --> 00:37:07,679
Do you think terrorists will attack me?

602
00:37:08,519 --> 00:37:09,320
No.

603
00:37:09,519 --> 00:37:11,360
We have no evidence pointing to that.

604
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:13,199
Not even a hint.

605
00:37:13,960 --> 00:37:16,239
Then will they target the people close to me?

606
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:18,159
They won't.

607
00:37:18,199 --> 00:37:19,760
They've always been very direct.

608
00:37:21,440 --> 00:37:22,760
Luo Xi, you have to help me.

609
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:23,480
I mean it.

610
00:37:23,639 --> 00:37:26,079
Our Mr. Xiao has already been attacked.

611
00:37:26,320 --> 00:37:27,679
I'm definitely next.

612
00:37:27,679 --> 00:37:29,519
No, if they can't find me,

613
00:37:29,599 --> 00:37:31,119
they'll go after the people around me.

614
00:37:31,119 --> 00:37:33,320
Like Yang Di and Nan Sheng.

615
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:34,800
They'll all be in danger.

616
00:37:35,400 --> 00:37:37,639
It's my fault for ignoring your advice,

617
00:37:37,840 --> 00:37:39,840
and sending a crane to help them.

618
00:37:50,480 --> 00:37:51,800
You said your boss

619
00:37:52,119 --> 00:37:53,639
was attacked by terrorists,

620
00:37:54,480 --> 00:37:56,679
and his injuries are pretty severe?

621
00:37:56,719 --> 00:37:58,000
And they're too afraid to call the police?

622
00:37:58,000 --> 00:37:59,559
That's why I had to come to you.

623
00:38:01,719 --> 00:38:03,639
Has your company's recent business

624
00:38:03,719 --> 00:38:05,199
conflicted with them in any way?

625
00:38:07,079 --> 00:38:08,000
Militants...

626
00:38:08,000 --> 00:38:10,559
their methods are always blunt and brutal.

627
00:38:10,880 --> 00:38:12,280
Your boss is still alive,

628
00:38:12,960 --> 00:38:13,920
so this whole thing

629
00:38:14,239 --> 00:38:16,440
probably has nothing to do with militants.

630
00:38:22,280 --> 00:38:23,760
Uncle Qu, no need to get soup for An Da.

631
00:38:23,760 --> 00:38:25,039
She won't be back for dinner today.

632
00:38:25,920 --> 00:38:26,960
Look at me, I totally forgot.

633
00:38:26,960 --> 00:38:28,360
She called me earlier,

634
00:38:28,679 --> 00:38:31,440
saying their hotel is upgrading security,

635
00:38:31,440 --> 00:38:33,639
so she's staying on shift and won't be back.

636
00:38:33,639 --> 00:38:34,679
Security upgrade?

637
00:38:35,280 --> 00:38:37,239
Was Plato Hotel attacked again?

638
00:38:37,480 --> 00:38:38,400
No, no.

639
00:38:38,719 --> 00:38:39,400
Oh, right.

640
00:38:39,400 --> 00:38:41,880
She kept asking me how to defend against...

641
00:38:41,880 --> 00:38:43,239
terrorist attacks.

642
00:38:44,760 --> 00:38:47,079
She's worried about Xiao Chuan's injury.

643
00:38:47,280 --> 00:38:48,960
She thought dispatching the crane

644
00:38:48,960 --> 00:38:50,599
drew the militants' attention.

645
00:38:50,599 --> 00:38:51,880
Actually, take a look at this.

646
00:38:54,280 --> 00:38:56,960
Xiao Chuan married a local woman,

647
00:38:57,079 --> 00:38:58,639
and his wife accidentally injured him.

648
00:38:58,639 --> 00:38:59,559
That's why he's in the hospital.

649
00:39:02,519 --> 00:39:04,360
Does An Da know about this?

650
00:39:04,679 --> 00:39:06,280
How could she possibly know?

651
00:39:07,639 --> 00:39:10,480
An Da blames herself this time,

652
00:39:10,639 --> 00:39:12,400
and she's tormenting herself over it.

653
00:39:13,280 --> 00:39:14,079
Looks like

654
00:39:14,639 --> 00:39:15,559
we know something this time

655
00:39:15,559 --> 00:39:16,920
that An Da doesn't.

656
00:39:20,480 --> 00:39:22,719
Th-Then should we tell her?

657
00:39:28,079 --> 00:39:28,880
Just drink your soup.

658
00:39:58,079 --> 00:40:01,039
Mr. Xiao, is your injury feeling better?

659
00:40:01,039 --> 00:40:02,000
Much better.

660
00:40:05,719 --> 00:40:07,519
Though not completely healed.

661
00:40:08,119 --> 00:40:10,719
The wound is mostly healed,

662
00:40:10,880 --> 00:40:13,280
but these past couple of days, my neck...

663
00:40:13,280 --> 00:40:14,599
has been acting up again.

664
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:20,280
I'm really sorry.

665
00:40:20,719 --> 00:40:22,400
I didn't fully understand

666
00:40:22,400 --> 00:40:24,159
the local dynamics.

667
00:40:25,239 --> 00:40:27,679
But the ones who attacked you...

668
00:40:27,679 --> 00:40:29,760
did you see how many there were?

669
00:40:29,840 --> 00:40:31,760
How could I possibly tell?

670
00:40:31,800 --> 00:40:32,920
That punk...

671
00:40:32,960 --> 00:40:35,119
moved faster than lightning,

672
00:40:35,119 --> 00:40:36,719
and vanished in a flash.

673
00:40:50,199 --> 00:40:52,679
That's a nice remote-control plane.

674
00:40:53,239 --> 00:40:53,840
You've got good taste.

675
00:40:54,679 --> 00:40:57,079
It's this year's limited edition.

676
00:40:57,159 --> 00:40:58,719
Do you know how many US dollars...

677
00:40:58,719 --> 00:40:59,639
...I spent to get it?

678
00:40:59,760 --> 00:41:00,960
It wasn't easy at all.

679
00:41:02,159 --> 00:41:03,039
Why don't you give it a try?

680
00:41:04,079 --> 00:41:05,599
No way, I don't know how.

681
00:41:05,960 --> 00:41:07,840
Come on, how could you not know?

682
00:41:07,840 --> 00:41:09,159
As an employee of our hotel,

683
00:41:09,159 --> 00:41:10,239
you must master this skill.

684
00:41:10,239 --> 00:41:12,000
Come on, come on.

685
00:41:12,360 --> 00:41:13,880
The left stick is for takeoff and landing.

686
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:15,039
The right one is for steering.

687
00:41:16,199 --> 00:41:17,960
Give it a shot. Up, up, up!

688
00:41:18,920 --> 00:41:21,400
That's it! Steady, steady, steady.

689
00:41:21,679 --> 00:41:22,599
Right, keep it steady.

690
00:41:22,800 --> 00:41:24,280
Whoa, watch out, watch out! Don't, don't!

691
00:41:24,760 --> 00:41:26,400
That almost hit the tree!

692
00:41:29,119 --> 00:41:30,360
Right, right, right.

693
00:41:31,000 --> 00:41:31,920
So? Isn't it fun?

694
00:41:32,000 --> 00:41:32,679
Let go of me.

695
00:41:32,880 --> 00:41:33,280
You...

696
00:41:33,320 --> 00:41:34,519
What do you think you're doing?

697
00:41:55,400 --> 00:41:57,239
Xiao... Mr. Xiao.

698
00:41:57,400 --> 00:41:59,400
About the hotel...

699
00:41:59,400 --> 00:42:00,800
You don't need to worry about it.

700
00:42:00,800 --> 00:42:01,960
Just focus on recovering.

701
00:42:04,719 --> 00:42:06,559
I don't care about the hotel.

702
00:42:07,119 --> 00:42:08,840
What I care about is my baby, you know?

703
00:42:13,440 --> 00:42:14,199
I'm so furious!

704
00:42:23,199 --> 00:42:24,000
You're back.

705
00:42:26,320 --> 00:42:27,320
Let me carry that. Let me help.

706
00:42:27,320 --> 00:42:28,840
No need. It's my own stuff.

707
00:42:28,840 --> 00:42:29,679
I can carry it myself.

708
00:42:33,320 --> 00:42:34,119
Sha Lan.

709
00:42:34,840 --> 00:42:36,679
Don't be so hard on me.

710
00:42:36,719 --> 00:42:38,039
I'm not a bad guy.

711
00:42:39,079 --> 00:42:40,679
Whenever you act like this,

712
00:42:40,679 --> 00:42:42,000
you're always after a favor.

713
00:42:42,199 --> 00:42:43,639
Instead of bugging Wei Tian this time,

714
00:42:43,639 --> 00:42:44,679
you're targeting me.

715
00:42:45,599 --> 00:42:47,039
You definitely have an ulterior motive.

716
00:42:47,920 --> 00:42:49,599
No, no!

717
00:42:50,679 --> 00:42:51,639
I'll just say it straight.

718
00:42:51,639 --> 00:42:54,880
Can you help fix a remote-control plane?

719
00:42:58,880 --> 00:43:00,679
I don't want to. Ask someone else.

720
00:43:01,000 --> 00:43:02,719
Sha Lan! No, wait...

721
00:43:03,199 --> 00:43:04,239
Why won't she help me?

722
00:43:05,320 --> 00:43:06,079
Personality.

723
00:43:06,800 --> 00:43:07,599
Temperament.

724
00:43:08,519 --> 00:43:10,679
You need to evolve into a better person.

725
00:43:11,880 --> 00:43:14,400
Haven't I evolved enough?

726
00:43:15,000 --> 00:43:16,440
I even went to see Xiao Chuan today.

727
00:43:16,440 --> 00:43:17,599
I wanted to find out

728
00:43:17,599 --> 00:43:19,239
how he really got injured.

729
00:43:19,239 --> 00:43:20,000
Was it

730
00:43:20,199 --> 00:43:20,960
connected to

731
00:43:20,960 --> 00:43:23,199
those terrorists in Area A9?

732
00:43:23,599 --> 00:43:25,960
He even fell into that ravine and, well...

733
00:43:27,000 --> 00:43:28,639
and ended up hurting himself.

734
00:43:28,639 --> 00:43:30,840
I really just want to do things right,

735
00:43:31,000 --> 00:43:33,559
but every time, it ends in a mess.
